# Force GitHub Linguist to accurately report C# and ignore any third-party or build scripts
*.js linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored
*.lua linguist-vendored
*.luac linguist-vendored
*.iss linguist-vendored
*.bat linguist-vendored
*.cmd linguist-vendored
publish/** linguist-vendored
publish-selfcontained/** linguist-vendored
bin/** linguist-vendored
obj/** linguist-vendored

*.cs linguist-detectable=true
*.cs linguist-language=C#
